{"logId": "10b3ba13-6545-4b1e-b695-899cbc9599cc", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header", "block_content": "DÍ", "block_bbox": [121, 89, 192, 128], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 89.0], [192.0, 89.0], [192.0, 128.0], [121.0, 128.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "机动车驾驶员：", "block_bbox": [141, 183, 297, 213], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[141.0, 183.0], [297.0, 183.0], [297.0, 213.0], [141.0, 213.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一、不准酒后或者醉酒驾驶车辆。", "block_bbox": [140, 243, 433, 271], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[140.0, 243.0], [433.0, 243.0], [433.0, 271.0], [140.0, 271.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二、驾驶车辆不准闯红灯。", "block_bbox": [141, 277, 375, 304], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[141.0, 277.0], [375.0, 277.0], [375.0, 304.0], [141.0, 304.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "三、驾驶车辆不准超速行驶。", "block_bbox": [141, 310, 394, 337], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[141.0, 310.0], [394.0, 310.0], [394.0, 337.0], [141.0, 337.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四、驾驶车辆载客不得超载、超重。", "block_bbox": [142, 343, 452, 371], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[142.0, 343.0], [452.0, 343.0], [452.0, 371.0], [142.0, 371.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "五、不准违规将车乱停乱放。", "block_bbox": [140, 377, 394, 404], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[140.0, 377.0], [394.0, 377.0], [394.0, 404.0], [140.0, 404.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "六、驾驶车辆上道路行驶需放置检验合格标志", "block_bbox": [139, 410, 546, 437], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[139.0, 410.0], [546.0, 410.0], [546.0, 437.0], [139.0, 437.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "七、不准无证驾驶车辆，不准将车辆交予无证人员驾驶", "block_bbox": [138, 444, 630, 470], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[138.0, 444.0], [606.0, 444.0], [606.0, 469.0], [138.0, 469.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "八、不准发生交通事故后逃逸。", "block_bbox": [139, 477, 415, 503], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[139.0, 477.0], [415.0, 477.0], [415.0, 503.0], [139.0, 503.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "九、凡违反上述规定造成交通事故的后果自负，构成犯罪的由司法机关处理。", "block_bbox": [138, 509, 743, 569], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[138.0, 509.0], [743.0, 509.0], [743.0, 569.0], [138.0, 569.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [781, 174, 1023, 344], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[781.0, 174.0], [1023.0, 174.0], [1023.0, 344.0], [781.0, 344.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [832, 379, 1026, 545], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[832.0, 379.0], [1026.0, 379.0], [1026.0, 545.0], [832.0, 545.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 593, 1123, 641], "block_id": 13, "block_order": null, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 593.0], [1123.0, 593.0], [1123.0, 641.0], [939.0, 641.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DL", "block_bbox": [121, 708, 192, 743], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 708.0], [192.0, 708.0], [192.0, 743.0], [121.0, 743.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "非机动车：", "block_bbox": [142, 801, 255, 831], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[142.0, 801.0], [255.0, 801.0], [255.0, 831.0], [142.0, 831.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一、非机动车（电动车、电动自行车、自行车等）应当在非机动车道行驶，不得进入机动车道，没有非机动车道的应当靠车行道的右侧行驶。", "block_bbox": [140, 840, 705, 940], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[140.0, 840.0], [705.0, 840.0], [705.0, 940.0], [140.0, 940.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二、电动车在非机动车车道内行驶时，最高时速不得超过十五公里。", "block_bbox": [142, 953, 704, 1017], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[142.0, 953.0], [704.0, 953.0], [704.0, 1017.0], [142.0, 1017.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三、遵守交通规定行驶。", "block_bbox": [143, 1037, 355, 1065], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[143.0, 1037.0], [355.0, 1037.0], [355.0, 1065.0], [143.0, 1065.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四、助动自行车、有动力装置的残疾人专用车应当接受公安交通管理部门的定期检验，未经公安交通管理部门检验，不得上道路行驶；禁止非机动车加装动力装置，拼装非机动车，擅自更换有动力装置的残疾人专用车、助动自行车的发动机。", "block_bbox": [140, 1086, 708, 1223], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[140.0, 1086.0], [708.0, 1086.0], [708.0, 1223.0], [140.0, 1223.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [746, 795, 1026, 972], "block_id": 20, "block_order": null, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[746.0, 795.0], [1026.0, 795.0], [1026.0, 972.0], [746.0, 972.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [734, 1011, 1042, 1188], "block_id": 21, "block_order": null, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[734.0, 1011.0], [1042.0, 1011.0], [1042.0, 1188.0], [734.0, 1188.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 